namespace pdg { /**

\fn pdg::FileManager::findClose(FileFindData inFindData)

\brief stop and cleanup after a file/directory search

This takes the original object returned from findFirst(), and cleans up after the search, releasing all resources used by the search.

\param inFindData the original object returned from findFirst(), which findNext() updates in place

\sa findFirst
\sa findNext

**/ }